# line 1160: NET_C(U58.7, GND) -> nc -- sheet 3 draws U58 pin 7 (DIS) unconnected; MAME's own comment says 'not connected'
# line 1704: NET_C(U2.9, U2.11, U9.1, U9.4, U9.12, U9.13, U15.1, U15.2, U20.4, U20.6, U20.8, U20.10, U20.12, U33.8, U33.9, U33.10, U33.11, U35.5, U35.6, U40.1, U40.3, U40.5) -> nc -- tied to one another in MAME's "Unconnected inputs" block
# line 1704: MAME ties U2.9, U2.11, U20.4, U20.6 off as unused, but the circuit uses them -- the tie is dropped
#
# Corrected from the sheet (the notes below say what was read where):
#   parts the sheet draws that MAME does not have: Y1 20MHz
#   sheet 6: U2's three spare inputs tied together to ground: U2.5 U2.9 U2.11
#   sheet 5: U20 pin 6 is WC1+, to the shaft encoder: U20.6 (WC1_P)
#   sheet 5: U20 pin 4 is WC2+, to the shaft encoder: U20.4 (WC2_P)
#   sheet 5: Q29's collector into U20 pin 5: U20.5 (Q29_COLLECTOR)
#   sheet 5: Q30's collector into U20 pin 3: U20.3 (Q30_COLLECTOR)
